","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":true,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/5344a60777f6","commits":[{"id":"5344a60777f63feac84f2b2726838588d49df779","tree_id":"e50bc787edfc49b9f734bd3b09143fd91f863a5c","distinct":true,"message":"fix(hermes-750,800): repoint 3 check scripts at the current prompt registry\n\nhermes-750-prompt-runtime-check.py, hermes-800-foundation-check.py, and\nhermes-800-resume-builder-suggestion-check.py all still referenced\nresume_builder.summary_improve / resume_builder.bullet_rewrite /\nmatching.fit_explanation -- prompt IDs retired when the live Langfuse\nregistry moved to the jf.* naming scheme. hermes-800-foundation-check.py\nand hermes-800-resume-builder-suggestion-check.py were a pure rename fix\n(app/resume_builder/adapters.py already used jf.resume.summary.generate\nand jf.resume.experience.rewrite -- only the test assertions were stale).\n\nhermes-750-prompt-runtime-check.py needed more: the live registry also\nmoved from raw source_text/target_role/constraints variables to a\nContext-Card-based shape (candidate_card/job_card objects,\napp/context/models.py), and prompt.domain changed from resume_builder\nto resume. Rewrote the dry-run payloads to match the current schema and\nempirically verified each assertion against the live registry before\nwriting it (GET /prompts/jf.resume.summary.generate for the schema, live\nPOST /prompts/run calls for the positive path, the fabrication-block\npath via candidate_card.summary_snippet, and the missing-required-\nvariables path) rather than guessing at what would pass.\n\nAll three verified passing against the live hermes-api container.","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:57:50-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/5344a60777f63feac84f2b2726838588d49df779","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-21T04:57:50-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-21T04:57:50-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["scripts/hermes-750-prompt-runtime-check.py","scripts/hermes-800-foundation-check.py","scripts/hermes-800-resume-builder-suggestion-check.py"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"5344a60777f63feac84f2b2726838588d49df779","tree_id":"e50bc787edfc49b9f734bd3b09143fd91f863a5c","distinct":true,"message":"fix(hermes-750,800): repoint 3 check scripts at the current prompt registry\n\nhermes-750-prompt-runtime-check.py, hermes-800-foundation-check.py, and\nhermes-800-resume-builder-suggestion-check.py all still referenced\nresume_builder.summary_improve / resume_builder.bullet_rewrite /\nmatching.fit_explanation -- prompt IDs retired when the live Langfuse\nregistry moved to the jf.* naming scheme. hermes-800-foundation-check.py\nand hermes-800-resume-builder-suggestion-check.py were a pure rename fix\n(app/resume_builder/adapters.py already used jf.resume.summary.generate\nand jf.resume.experience.rewrite -- only the test assertions were stale).\n\nhermes-750-prompt-runtime-check.py needed more: the live registry also\nmoved from raw source_text/target_role/constraints variables to a\nContext-Card-based shape (candidate_card/job_card objects,\napp/context/models.py), and prompt.domain changed from resume_builder\nto resume. Rewrote the dry-run payloads to match the current schema and\nempirically verified each assertion against the live registry before\nwriting it (GET /prompts/jf.resume.summary.generate for the schema, live\nPOST /prompts/run calls for the positive path, the fabrication-block\npath via candidate_card.summary_snippet, and the missing-required-\nvariables path) rather than guessing at what would pass.\n\nAll three verified passing against the live hermes-api container.","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:57:50-04:00